# A smart home alarm system that triggers if EITHER sensor fires.
# Written in plain English.

make a neuron named motion_detector with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named door_sensor with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named siren with threshold 1 and leak 0

put physical_motion into the input of motion_detector
put physical_door into the input of door_sensor

# FIX: Use 'merge' (OR logic) instead of 'combine' (AND logic)
# FIX: Use 'neuron' for sensors so they fire immediately, not 'synapse'
merge the spike from motion_detector and door_sensor into the input of siren

start the system
